# Sample fcloud console config — copy to ~/.fcloud_console_config and fill in.
#
# === EASIEST refresh path (HAR + parser) ===
# 1. Open https://console.cnomnibot.com/omnibot, log in.
# 2. F12 -> Network -> tick "Preserve log".
# 3. Click any task's Start/Pause button.
# 4. Right-click any Network row -> "Save all as HAR with content".
# 5. python3 scripts/fcloud/refresh_console_config_from_har.py <path/to/console.har>
# 6. Verify: python3 scripts/fcloud/fcloud_workflow.py console-token-info
# 7. Delete the HAR (it contains the live JWT and cookies).
#
# Full procedure / troubleshooting:
#   docs/soar_2026_changes/HOWTO_refresh_fcloud_console_config.en.md
#
# === Manual fallback ===
# 1. F12 -> Network -> click Start/Pause -> find PUT /api/thd/pg/api/v1/jobs/<id>/{start,pause}.
# 2. Copy `authorization`, `cookie` from request headers; `<id>` from URL.
# 3. Paste into the four fields below.
#
# JWT TTL is approximately 1 week. When start/pause returns HTTP 401/403,
# refresh FCLOUD_CONSOLE_AUTH (and Cookie) here.

FCLOUD_CONSOLE_BASE_URL=https://console.cnomnibot.com
FCLOUD_CONSOLE_AUTH=<paste the value of the `authorization` header, starts with eyJ...>
FCLOUD_CONSOLE_COOKIE=<paste the full `Cookie` header value (lang=...; JSESSIONID=...)>
FCLOUD_CONSOLE_USERNAME=<your login email>
FCLOUD_CONSOLE_JOB_ID=<32-char hex job id from the request URL>
